    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LightCells is an elegantly crafted minimalist logic puzzle game that provides players with a rich and engaging experience through its blend of simplicity and depth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features clear and straightforward rules, generating a vast array of puzzles that encourage intriguing exploration. Players are invited to discover clues, experiment with various elements, and assemble the overall solution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly encourage you to join us on this enriching journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 140 Distinct Levels</strong>: Experience a diverse selection of puzzles that maintain a well-balanced difficulty curve, ensuring accessibility and enjoyment for players of all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uniquely Designed Solutions</strong>: Engage your logic and intuition with thoughtfully crafted puzzles that require careful consideration and creative problem-solving.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen-like Experience</strong>: Enjoy a tranquil, zen-like atmosphere that enhances your gameplay as you immerse yourself in each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Aesthetics</strong>: Appreciate soothing visuals complemented by gentle music and interactive elements, creating a serene and captivating environment for your gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Mode</strong>: Explore endless possibilities with the Infinite Mode, designed to nurture your creativity and problem-solving potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Friendly Day/Night Mode</strong>: Take advantage of the option to switch between day and night modes, thoughtfully designed to ensure your comfort during extended play sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely hope you find joy and fulfillment as you explore the challenges and discoveries that LightCells has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LightCells is an elegantly crafted minimalist logic puzzle game that provides players with a rich and engaging experience through its blend of simplicity and depth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features clear and straightforward rules, generating a vast array of puzzles that encourage intriguing exploration. Players are invited to discover clues, experiment with various elements, and assemble the overall solution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly encourage you to join us on this enriching journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 140 Distinct Levels</strong>: Experience a diverse selection of puzzles that maintain a well-balanced difficulty curve, ensuring accessibility and enjoyment for players of all skill levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uniquely Designed Solutions</strong>: Engage your logic and intuition with thoughtfully crafted puzzles that require careful consideration and creative problem-solving.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen-like Experience</strong>: Enjoy a tranquil, zen-like atmosphere that enhances your gameplay as you immerse yourself in each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Aesthetics</strong>: Appreciate soothing visuals complemented by gentle music and interactive elements, creating a serene and captivating environment for your gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Mode</strong>: Explore endless possibilities with the Infinite Mode, designed to nurture your creativity and problem-solving potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye-Friendly Day/Night Mode</strong>: Take advantage of the option to switch between day and night modes, thoughtfully designed to ensure your comfort during extended play sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely hope you find joy and fulfillment as you explore the challenges and discoveries that LightCells has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
